entries[345179] = { ["name"] = "Disposable Spectrophasic Reanimator", ["text"] = "2 sec cast\nTools: Arclight Spanner , Blacksmith Hammer\nReagents:\nWormfed Gear Assembly , Mortal Coiled Spring , Handful of Laestrite Bolts (4), Machinist's Oil\nProfession:\nShadowlands Engineering (50)\nTrainer:\nMachinist Au'gur\nZone:\nOribos\nCost:\n2\n\nUse: Rephases the anima strings on a target that recently died, restoring them to life with 60% health and 20% mana. Castable in combat.\n\nChance to backfire, phasing the wrong strings on a target resulting in a loss of vitality.\n\nCannot be used by players higher than level 60. (10 Min Cooldown)\n50\nRequires Shadowlands Engineering\n(50)\n\"While this device can certainly bring the dead back to life, it may also bring the living to the brink of death.\"" }
